    description: "27 analyzers emit stable_id as location-based strings ({lang}:{path}:{name}:{kind}) that survive line shifts but not renames. Replace with signature-based hashes from the base-class compute_stable_id(). Affected analyzers: PureScript, V, Tcl, Haxe, Gleam, Odin, Fennel, Scheme, Racket, Meson, MATLAB, Apex, Janet, Jsonnet, Prisma, Luau, Pascal, Fish, Ada, D, Nim, ASM, HLSL, Starlark, Hack, Smithy, plus others. Depends on base-class compute_stable_id() being proven. See ADR-0014 Phase 2."  # 91d4
